{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat SUPPORT-TICKET.md; cat pubspec.yaml; cat lib/main.dart; cat lib/legacy_app.dart; cat lib/new_app.dart; cat lib/analytics.dart; ls -la'","aggregated_output":"# Ticket #4471: no session replays since the redesign\n\nReported by product, 2026-10-16.\n\nReplay tab in PostHog shows sessions only from users still on the old UI\n(the A/B group). Users on the new UI appear in Events (screens, taps,\n`loan_amount_changed`, `application_submitted` all arrive) but have no\nrecording. Project settings: Record user sessions = on, sampling 100%,\nminimum duration 0. Same posthog_flutter version for both groups, same build.\nname: loanly\ndescription: Loan calculator and application flow.\npublish_to: \"none\"\nversion: 2.4.0+61\n\nenvironment:\n  sdk: ^3.5.0\n\ndependencies:\n  flutter:\n    sdk: flutter\n  go_router: ^14.6.2\n  posthog_flutter: ^5.36.0\n\ndev_dependencies:\n  flutter_test:\n    sdk: flutter\n  flutter_lints: ^5.0.0\n\nflutter:\n  uses-material-design: true\nimport 'package:flutter/material.dart';\n\nimport 'analytics.dart';\nimport 'legacy_app.dart';\nimport 'new_app.dart';\n\nconst bool useNewUi = bool.fromEnvironment('NEW_UI', defaultValue: true);\n\nFuture<void> main() async {\n  WidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();\n  await Analytics.init();\n  runApp(useNewUi ? const NewApp() : const LegacyApp());\n}\nimport 'package:flutter/material.dart';\nimport 'package:posthog_flutter/posthog_flutter.dart';\n\nimport 'screens/calculator_screen.dart';\nimport 'screens/application_screen.dart';\n\n/// The old shell. Kept for the A/B group until the redesign is fully rolled out.\nclass LegacyApp extends StatelessWidget {\n  const LegacyApp({super.key});\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return PostHogWidget(\n      child: MaterialApp(\n        title: 'Loanly',\n        theme: ThemeData(colorSchemeSeed: Colors.teal),\n        navigatorObservers: [PosthogObserver()],\n        routes: {\n          '/': (_) => const CalculatorScreen(),\n          '/apply': (_) => const ApplicationScreen(),\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\nimport 'package:flutter/material.dart';\nimport 'package:go_router/go_router.dart';\nimport 'package:posthog_flutter/posthog_flutter.dart';\n\nimport 'screens/calculator_screen.dart';\nimport 'screens/application_screen.dart';\nimport 'screens/offers_screen.dart';\n\nfinal _router = GoRouter(\n  observers: [PosthogObserver()],\n  routes: [\n    GoRoute(path: '/', builder: (_, __) => const CalculatorScreen()),\n    GoRoute(path: '/apply', builder: (_, __) => const ApplicationScreen()),\n    GoRoute(path: '/offers', builder: (_, __) => const OffersScreen()),\n  ],\n);\n\n/// The redesigned shell (default since 2.3.0).\nclass NewApp extends StatelessWidget {\n  const NewApp({super.key});\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return MaterialApp.router(\n      title: 'Loanly',\n      theme: ThemeData(\n        colorSchemeSeed: Colors.indigo,\n        useMaterial3: true,\n      ),\n      routerConfig: _router,\n    );\n  }\n}\nimport 'package:posthog_flutter/posthog_flutter.dart';\n\nclass Analytics {\n  static Future<void> init() async {\n    final config = PostHogConfig('phc_REPLACE_ME_IN_CI');\n    config.host = 'https://eu.i.posthog.com';\n    config.captureApplicationLifecycleEvents = true;\n    config.sessionReplay = true;\n    config.sessionReplayConfig.maskAllTexts = true;\n    config.sessionReplayConfig.maskAllImages = false;\n    await Posthog().setup(config);\n  }\n\n  static Future<void> track(String event, [Map<String, Object>? props]) =>\n      Posthog().capture(eventName: event, properties: props);\n}\ntotal 32\ndrwx------    8 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   256 Oct 19 00:07 .\ndrwxrwxrwt  176 root                 wheel  5632 Oct 19 00:07 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x   12 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   384 Oct 19 00:07 .git\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel 